", "id": "727798082914645", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_727798086247978_7927465019836939760_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n9x8efT9JWEQ7kNvwFqpyWg&_nc_oc=Adpz3PipSzLcHOlxkXjHJECAXaU8g8YVH4JiSUqinSiqxWNydLF0E-gxjozsf65VX7g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM627mrrohO_i2eZMYzEd-VDxDt21lgCs1gNFhDDm6pRw&oe=6AC51FBC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_Skinwalker.png", "id": "610206122074633", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393909_610206125407966_8943337466549821229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZmhzbX3lGi4Q7kNvwFX7GSU&_nc_oc=AdpGggTevp_08CeEc4bZjdDbIHpsB8gNN3f9ENjMcFEMjsBT_YNFzkxc8Jz5_1JVCrQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMpB_Dui7K_G5I7jiO3cSx7NsMGhC6OTipsPgrZCXaDhQ&oe=6AC4F810"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_DoubleDoor.png", "id": "739262415278358", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_739262421945024_4016414250370504064_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XQxa_quESlEQ7kNvwE-ktqB&_nc_oc=AdpYF1BRuDlsnnlAAAXdWLmUcnxKeKMaKQABDAzKdzKXfACc3mfmDSuKeygW7X3vF8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOs7ORj-oXihPDSa0NsZFhnB4-nvTLE_hGOrGNSSyIqQg&oe=6AC50C44"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_ParcelStacking.png", "id": "553200994506830", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_553200997840163_8421225844214804779_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kExv0K2DRUgQ7kNvwHnYBvn&_nc_oc=Adp0GgP9UazVxfd2hlI4kP7lFsNOrX0wT7g2D812VkDzc3cNitI5uT7ScBTfloBzDHQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNX2gh4cwlnGZ_2Sh3BU1pfGkiSJr_B3mMAWJTLFYN-VQ&oe=6AC4F69B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_DD_01.png", "id": "560042380474257", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391883_560042383807590_668531239392494770_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aEnh7N86nxQQ7kNvwGO5BGL&_nc_oc=AdokRzGhJyIfpbhYe9KNOkafFtnaHeVVSXEMteiQ6JBfWt3qu4fTZ6jese-ALrYmcdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN6lNLBJ-YxJRP-6k9Q7h64Rk96VdxLKqhxIp4t47r-rQ&oe=6AC51CB0"}, "display_name": "Deadly Delivery", "keywords": ["Delivery", "Lethal", "Deadly", "Multiplayer", "Horror"], "long_description": "# Your shift starts now. Good luck.\n\nIn Deadly Delivery, you and your fellow delivery goblins are tasked with delivering parcels into pitch-black mines full of... things. Armed with questionable equipment, you'll sneak, sprint, and scream your way through procedurally generated tunnels.\n\n\n\n# Features\n# \ud83d\udc80 Deadly Co-op Missions\n Team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op. Coordinate, deliver, and survive\u2014or watch your coworkers get picked off one by one.\n\n\n# \ud83d\udd26 Physics based VR Horror\n Built for VR with a physics based world, spatial audio, and proximity voice chat. \nHaul a variety of parcels, climb on other players or give them a slap of encouragement \n\n\n# \ud83d\udc79 Monsters With Personality\n Face off against terrifying entities, some may even look and act like your teammates. Learn their patterns \u2014 or feed them your friends.", "short_description": "An online VR co-op horror game about delivering parcels into haunted mines. \nAvoid monsters, drop off packages, and pray you reach the quota! \nTeam up with up to 3 other delivery goblins, survive your shift and pay back your student loans."}]}, "developer_name": "Flat Head Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://deadlydelivery.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Flat Head Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://deadlydelivery.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "274332603592553